item.description:
As Israeli voters head to the polls today, the Democratic litmus test over support for Israel is top of mind for voters in the most expensive US House race in the country. Rep. Jared Moskowitz speaks to CNN about why he is not changing his pro-Israel stance despite a nationwide wave of progressive blowback.&nbsp;

---&nbsp;

Guest: Edward-Isaac Dovere, CNN Senior Reporter&nbsp;

Host: David Rind&nbsp;

Producer: Paola Ortiz&nbsp;

Showrunner: Felicia Patinkin
